  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">被動護盾（Passive Shield）是一款可設定的模組，會對護盾機制進行一些調整。當護盾握於副手且未在使用時，將不會被渲染顯示。玩家每次按下右鍵舉起護盾時，它便會重新顯示。當護盾未舉起時，仍會抵消部分傷害。預設額外抵消 33%，但可在設定檔中更改。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">當護盾閒置握於主手時，同樣會提供被動保護。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s 用戶端套件\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：用戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideShieldWhenNotInUse</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，除非玩家按下右鍵，否則護盾將會隱藏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>passiveShieldPercentageDamageNegated</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：0.3333，最小值：0.0，最大值：1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當玩家手持未舉起的護盾受到攻擊時，將被抵消的傷害百分比。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>護盾握於副手時會隱藏，直到舉起為止：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未持護盾時的預設傷害：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>護盾在副手中未舉起時，被動抵消傷害：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"530\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>護盾在主手中未舉起時，被動抵消傷害：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何模組包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於各模組頁面過多，我無法逐一追蹤評論，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>反映。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
